H2O, LDA: as h2o_restart/step1.inp, but writes RESTART.1 as a stream file with MPI-IO from 2 CP groups

&CPMD
 OPTIMIZE WAVEFUNCTION
 CP_GROUPS
  2
 USE_MPI_IO
 USE_OUT_STREAM
 CONVERGENCE ORBITALS
  1.0d-3
&END
&SYSTEM
 SYMMETRY
  1
 ANGSTROM
 CELL
  7.0 1.0 1.0 0.0 0.0 0.0
 CUTOFF
  50.0
&END
&DFT
 FUNCTIONAL LDA
&END
&ATOMS
*O_GO.psp
 LMAX=P
  1
  0.0000  0.0000  0.1173
*H_GO.psp
 LMAX=S
  2
  0.0000  0.7572 -0.4692
  0.0000 -0.7572 -0.4692
&END
